{
  "<div align=\"center\">\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/wordmark.svg#gh-light-mode-only\" width=\"220\" height=\"69\" alt=\"Papilot\"><img src=\"docs/assets/wordmark-dark.svg#gh-dark-mode-only\" width=\"220\" height=\"69\" alt=\"Papilot\"><br>**Next-Generation AI LaTeX Editor**\n\n# Don't read or write `.tex`<br>Just work on the <img src=\"docs/assets/pdf.svg\" width=\"34\" height=\"41\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"PDF\">\n\nA **new paradigm** for responsible writing and typesetting with AI.\n\n**[Download Papilot](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest)** for <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/apple-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/apple.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture>&nbsp;macOS (Apple&nbsp;Silicon&nbsp;/&nbsp;Intel),<br><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/linux-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/linux.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture>&nbsp;Linux (AppImage / <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/ubuntu.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;Ubuntu / <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/debian.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;Debian / <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/nixos.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;NixOS) or Windows (x64),<br>or run `npm install -g papilot`.\n\n<a href=\"https://papilot.ai\">\n<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-compact-dark.png\">\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-dark.png\">\n  <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-compact.png\">\n  <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero.png\" alt=\"Papilot shows an AI edit as a typeset before-and-after on the PDF, with Accept, Reject and Comment.\" width=\"900\">\n</picture>\n</a>\n\n</div>\n\n## 📄 You care about the PDF<br>Not the `.tex` behind it\n\nPapers, theses, books, slides: readers only ever see the typeset page.<br>\n**So the page is where you should work, too.**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm-compact-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm-compact.png\">\n    <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm.png\" alt=\"Writing LaTeX by hand, then checking LaTeX diffs from AI, and now Papilot: reviewing the PDF.\" width=\"900\">\n  </picture>\n</p>\n\n**No more compiling diffs in your head.**<br>\nA source diff makes you *imagine* the PDF. Papilot *shows* it to you, typeset.\n\n## 👉 Point at the page and say what you want\n\nMark a sentence, an equation or a figure, and write a note.<br>\n**Your agent finds the source. You never open a `.tex` file.**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app-compact-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app-compact.png\">\n    <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app.png\" alt=\"Papilot with a box around an equation and a highlighted sentence on the PDF, each with a note, both added to the next task.\" width=\"900\">\n  </picture>\n</p>\n\n<a id=\"features\"></a>\n\n## 🔒 Your files stay yours\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/folder.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Plain files on your machine.** Every change lands in your Git history.\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/git.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Sync with coauthors through Git.** Pull, push, and let an agent resolve conflicts.\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/code.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Free and open source.** MIT licensed, for macOS, Linux and Windows.\n\n<a id=\"agents\"></a>\n\n## 🤖 Bring the AI agent you already use\n\n<!-- BEGIN AGENT ICONS -->\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"docs/guide.md#agents\">\n    <picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/compact-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/desktop-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/compact.svg\">\n      <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/desktop.svg\" alt=\"Codex, Claude, Cursor, Copilot, Grok, Antigravity, Kimi, GLM, DeepSeek, Qwen, OpenCode\" width=\"816\">\n    </picture>\n  </a>\n</p>\n<!-- END AGENT ICONS -->\n\n<a id=\"quick-start\"></a>\n\n## 🚀 Get started\n\n1. **Install.** [Download the app](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest) for macOS, Linux or Windows, or run `npm install -g papilot` (Node.js 22.22+). You also need Git and TeX Live or MacTeX.\n2. **Open your project.** Choose the folder with your `.tex` files. Papilot builds the PDF.\n3. **Pick an agent.** Use the CLI login or API key you already have, then mark up the page.\n\nWant a sample first? Run `papilot demo`. Details are in the [guide](docs/guide.md#install-and-run).\n\n<a id=\"documentation-and-community\"></a>\n\n## 🤝 Community\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/issue.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Found a bug or missing a feature?** [Open an issue](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/issues/new/choose), even a rough one.\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/discussion.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Have a question or an idea?** [Start a discussion](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/discussions).\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/pull-request.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Become a contributor.** Pull requests are very welcome, including ones written with AI agents. Start with the [contributing guide](.github/CONTRIBUTING.md).\n\n---\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n<p data-language-switcher><sub><a href=\"README.md\">English</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.zh-CN.md\">简体中文</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.zh-Hant.md\">繁體中文</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.ja.md\">日本語</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.ko.md\">한국어</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.de.md\">Deutsch</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.fr.md\">Français</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.es.md\">Español</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.pt.md\">Português</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.it.md\">Italiano</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.sv.md\">Svenska</a></sub></p>\n\n</div>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><sub><a href=\"LICENSE\">MIT</a> © 2026 PapilotAI. Thanks to our friends at <a href=\"https://linux.do/\">LINUX DO</a>.</sub></p>\n": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/wordmark.svg#gh-light-mode-only\" width=\"220\" height=\"69\" alt=\"Papilot\"><img src=\"docs/assets/wordmark-dark.svg#gh-dark-mode-only\" width=\"220\" height=\"69\" alt=\"Papilot\"><br>**차세대 AI LaTeX 편집기**\n\n# `.tex`을 읽거나 직접 작성하지 마세요<br>그저 <img src=\"docs/assets/pdf.svg\" width=\"34\" height=\"41\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"PDF\"> 위에서 작업하세요\n\nAI와 함께하는 책임감 있는 집필 및 조판의 **새로운 패러다임**.\n\n<picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/apple-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/apple.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture>&nbsp;macOS(Apple&nbsp;Silicon&nbsp;/&nbsp;Intel)<br>및 <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/linux-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/linux.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture>&nbsp;Linux(AppImage / <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/ubuntu.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;Ubuntu / <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/debian.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;Debian / <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/nixos.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;NixOS) 또는 Windows (x64)용 **[Papilot 다운로드](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest)**,<br>또는 `npm install -g papilot`을 실행하세요.\n\n<a href=\"https://papilot.ai\">\n<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-compact-dark.png\">\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-dark.png\">\n  <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-compact.png\">\n  <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero.png\" alt=\"Papilot은 수락, 거절 및 댓글 기능과 함께 AI 수정 사항을 PDF 상에서 조판된 전후 비교로 보여줍니다.\" width=\"900\">\n</picture>\n</a>\n\n</div>\n\n## 📄 중요한 것은 PDF입니다<br>그 이면의 `.tex` 코드가 아닙니다\n\n논문, 학위논문, 서적, 슬라이드까지 독자가 보는 것은 오직 조판된 페이지뿐입니다.<br>\n**따라서 작업하는 곳 역시 페이지 위여야 합니다.**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm-compact-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm-compact.png\">\n    <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm.png\" alt=\"수작업으로 LaTeX을 작성하던 방식, AI가 만든 LaTeX 변경 내역을 확인하던 방식을 넘어, 이제 Papilot으로 PDF를 직접 검토합니다.\" width=\"900\">\n  </picture>\n</p>\n\n**더 이상 머릿속으로 변경 내역을 컴파일하지 마세요.**<br>\n소스 코드 비교는 PDF 결과를 *상상*하게 만들지만, Papilot은 조판된 결과를 직접 *보여줍니다*.\n\n## 👉 페이지에서 원하는 곳을 가리키고 지시하세요\n\n문장, 수식 또는 그림을 표시하고 주석을 작성하세요.<br>\n**에이전트가 소스 위치를 찾아냅니다. `.tex` 파일을 열 필요가 전혀 없습니다.**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app-compact-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app-compact.png\">\n    <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app.png\" alt=\"PDF의 수식 주위에 상자 표시가 있고 문장이 강조 표시되어 있으며, 각각에 주석이 달리고 다음 작업에 추가된 Papilot 화면.\" width=\"900\">\n  </picture>\n</p>\n\n<a id=\"features\"></a>\n\n## 🔒 파일의 소유권은 온전히 사용자에게 있습니다\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/folder.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**로컬 기기의 일반 파일.** 모든 변경 사항은 Git 기록에 남습니다.\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/git.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Git을 통한 공동 저자와의 동기화.** 풀(pull)하고 푸시(push)하며, 충돌 해결은 에이전트에게 맡기세요.\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/code.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**무료 및 오픈 소스.** MIT 라이선스로 macOS, Linux, Windows를 지원합니다.\n\n<a id=\"agents\"></a>\n\n## 🤖 기존에 사용하던 AI 에이전트를 그대로 연결하세요\n\n<!-- BEGIN AGENT ICONS -->\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"docs/guide.md#agents\">\n    <picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/compact-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/desktop-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/compact.svg\">\n      <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/desktop.svg\" alt=\"Codex, Claude, Cursor, Copilot, Grok, Antigravity, Kimi, GLM, DeepSeek, Qwen, OpenCode\" width=\"816\">\n    </picture>\n  </a>\n</p>\n<!-- END AGENT ICONS -->\n\n<a id=\"quick-start\"></a>\n\n## 🚀 시작하기\n\n1. **설치.** macOS, Linux, Windows용 [앱을 다운로드](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest)하거나 `npm install -g papilot`(Node.js 22.22+)을 실행하세요. 또한 Git과 TeX Live 또는 MacTeX이 필요합니다.\n2. **프로젝트 열기.** `.tex` 파일이 있는 폴더를 선택하세요. Papilot이 PDF를 빌드합니다.\n3. **에이전트 선택.** 이미 보유한 CLI 로그인이나 API 키를 사용한 뒤, 페이지에 표시를 남기세요.\n\n샘플을 먼저 체험해 보고 싶으신가요? `papilot demo`를 실행해 보세요. 자세한 내용은 [가이드](docs/guide.md#install-and-run)에 있습니다.\n\n<a id=\"documentation-and-community\"></a>\n\n## 🤝 커뮤니티\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/issue.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**버그를 발견하셨거나 필요한 기능이 있나요?** 간단한 내용이라도 좋으니 [이슈를 등록](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/issues/new/choose)해 주세요.\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/discussion.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**질문이나 아이디어가 있으신가요?** [토론을 시작](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/discussions)해 보세요.\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/pull-request.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**기여자가 되어 주세요.** AI 에이전트와 함께 작성한 풀 리퀘스트(PR)를 포함하여 모든 기여를 환영합니다. [기여 가이드](.github/CONTRIBUTING.md)부터 확인해 보세요.\n\n---\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n<p data-language-switcher><sub><a href=\"README.md\">English</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.zh-CN.md\">简体中文</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.zh-Hant.md\">繁體中文</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.ja.md\">日本語</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.ko.md\">한국어</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.de.md\">Deutsch</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.fr.md\">Français</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.es.md\">Español</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.pt.md\">Português</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.it.md\">Italiano</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.sv.md\">Svenska</a></sub></p>\n\n</div>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><sub><a href=\"LICENSE\">MIT</a> © 2026 PapilotAI. <a href=\"https://linux.do/\">LINUX DO</a>의 동료들에게 감사드립니다.</sub></p>\n"
